Chapter: IntLiteralOnePastMax

 9223372036854775808 is one past the largest Integer. Directly under a
 minus it is the smallest Integer and a legal literal (the ops fixture
 int-wrapping-spelling prints it); on its own it is CDX2071, and this
 chapter is the control that keeps the boundary where it was ruled.

Section: Definitions

  one-past : Integer = 9223372036854775808

  opening : Text = show one-past

